r the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =5+4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =5+4(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279777 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279778 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279779 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279780 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279781 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1041 "selection" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279777 13194139534164 true] [17592186279776 1110 #uuid "eff66a7a-8cd1-58b6-9920-4fbde340e975" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279777 1034 "5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279777 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279777 1111 #uuid "5027aa7b-3abb-5405-bf0a-6b7a0bdecb77" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279778 1034 "5+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279778 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279778 1111 #uuid "9c6ffaa9-b135-518c-8a15-6bbb5404501a" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279779 1034 "5x+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279779 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279779 1111 #uuid "3e617787-30ea-5b51-87b5-3297e7e66b2f" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279780 1034 "4-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279780 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279780 1111 #uuid "46662baf-dbaf-5fa1-a848-ef4c609dd1ba" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279781 1034 "5-\\frac{4x}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279781 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279781 1111 #uuid "5611dd09-3a40-5a7a-918d-617fafd54a02" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1017 #edb/ref 17592186279783 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1089 "q-110626" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1100 "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$  for $f(x)=15\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x+8x.$" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1113 #uuid "6d6be61e-f6db-56ce-b1fc-d0e38bd5fb06" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279782 1145 "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(15\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x+8x) \\\\  & =15\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)+8 \\\\  & =15(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})+8 \\\\  & =8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279784 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279785 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279786 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279787 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279788 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1041 "selection" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279785 13194139534164 true] [17592186279783 1110 #uuid "91e3b921-f045-5815-aed7-0a25dd310111" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279784 1034 "8+\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279784 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534164 true] [17592186279784 1111 #uuid "7c9af1f7-ae07-5974-a8e8-9114a0e809e0" 13194139534164 true] [17592186279785 1034 "8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" 13194139534164 true]